{"id": "EUVD-2026-76902", "enisaUuid": "33663e7b-3e9d-3e47-a549-77cc97300233", "description": "Freeciv versions 3.1.0 through 3.2.5 contain an out-of-bounds read vulnerability in sg_load_player_unit() when processing savegame files with invalid unit activity indices. An attacker can craft a malicious savegame file with an out-of-range activity index that bypasses bounds checking and causes a crash or limited heap memory exposure when loaded.", "datePublished": "2026-09-12T18:06:41", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-15T17:08:59", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:L/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/freeciv/freeciv/commit/ef0c76c2765fe383140eb1a70dbea1228844152e", "https://github.com/freeciv/freeciv", "https://redmine.freeciv.org/issues/2162", "https://github.com/freeciv/freeciv/blob/R3_2_5/server/savegame/savegame3.c#L6108", "https://github.com/freeciv/freeciv/releases/tag/R3_2_6", "https://github.com/freeciv/freeciv/blob/R3_2_5/server/savegame/savegame2.c#L4282", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/freeciv-3.1.0-through-3.2.5-out-of-bounds-read-via-savegame"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-90557", "GHSA-m27m-5mqj-h84f"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1bbb4f48-29fd-3aa8-ad10-9d862122ca84", "product": {"name": "freeciv", "vendor": {"name": "freeciv"}}, "product_version": "3.1.0 <3.2.6"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9732fa43-62c1-3abb-803c-d82568b61657", "vendor": {"name": "freeciv"}}], "isExploited": false}